WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:05.170
So Americium is another of the synthetic heavy
elements and it’s the

00:00:05.170 --> 00:00:10.630
only one which has found its way into households
on a routine basis. And

00:00:10.630 --> 00:00:13.760
the way it’s found its way into our households
is that it’s used in smoke

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:19.760
alarms. Because it’s just used in the components
which can detect a

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:24.110
different flow of ions which is what you get
when you’ve got smoke in air

00:00:24.110 --> 00:00:26.320
and that’s how these smoke detectors work.

